# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:3
translate italian lisalivingroom_acb88e92:

    # "Lisa's not here watching TV like she usually is. What's going on with her?"
    "Lisa non è qui a guardare la TV come fa di solito. Che le succede?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:4
translate italian lisalivingroom_b428ebd3:

    # "I guess she's still upset. Better just give her time."
    "Immagino sia ancora arrabbiata. Meglio darle un po’ di tempo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:16
translate italian lisalivingroom_28820f39:

    # "Lisa is in the living room watching television."
    "Lisa è in salotto a guardare la televisione."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:17
translate italian lisalivingroom_62054172:

    # sp "Hey, honey, I'm just watching some TV. Want to join me?"
    sp "Ehi, tesoro, sto solo guardando un po’ di TV. Ti va di unirti a me?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:21
translate italian lisatv_11b9ab1f:

    # sp "Sure, that sounds great."
    sp "Certo, mi sembra un’ottima idea."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:25
translate italian lisatv_683befdb:

    # "Lisa changes into her nightgown and we go sit in the living room together."
    "Lisa si mette la camicia da notte e andiamo a sederci insieme in salotto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:115
translate italian lisatvconversation_8d017aa1:

    # "I sit down next to her and we watch television together for a while."
    "Mi siedo accanto a lei e guardiamo la televisione insieme per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:117
translate italian lisatvconversation_3f78d36e:

    # "After the show is over, Lisa looks over to me."
    "Finito il programma, Lisa mi lancia un’occhiata."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:118
translate italian lisatvconversation_9938deea:

    # sp "Well, it's getting late. I'm going to go to bed, honey."
    sp "Beh, si sta facendo tardi. Vado a letto, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:119
translate italian lisatvconversation_db98731b:

    # pc "Alright, [mom]."
    pc "Va bene, [mom]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:120
translate italian lisatvconversation_b7fc26cb:

    # sp "Thanks for hanging out with me. Love you."
    sp "Grazie per avermi tenuto compagnia. Ti voglio bene."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:121
translate italian lisatvconversation_776fd6b3:

    # pc "Love you too, [mom]. Good night."
    pc "Anch’io ti voglio bene, [mom]. Buonanotte."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:122
translate italian lisatvconversation_0ffd2107:

    # sp "Good night."
    sp "Buonanotte."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:123
translate italian lisatvconversation_b9d79178:

    # "She gets up and walks towards her bedroom. I don't really want to watch any more TV, so I turn it off and leave as well."
    "Si alza e si dirige verso la sua camera da letto. Non ho proprio voglia di guardare più la TV, quindi la spengo e me ne vado anch’io."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Lisa/lisalivingroom.rpy:92
    old "Mess around with Lisa"
    new "Giocare un po’ con Lisa"

